#: fantina_fan/1
msgctxt "Tag Nom d'objet (MAJUSCULES)"
msgid "FAN"
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/skylar_fantina_content/0/3
msgctxt "Skylar"
msgid "Hang on! My Content Aware is going off!"
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/skylar_fantina_content/0/11
msgctxt "Skylar"
msgid "Fantina is your biggest fan - in more ways than one... Her behavior toward you might be considered similar to stalking."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/skylar_fantina_content/0/19
msgctxt "Skylar"
msgid "You cool with that? Or you want to skip it?"
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/skylar_fantina_content/0/30/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Let's skip it please!"
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/skylar_fantina_content/0/31/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "No, I'm okay with this type of stuff."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/skylar_fantina_content/0/c-0/16
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "How would you like your relationship with Fantina to resolve?"
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/skylar_fantina_content/0/c-0/21/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Love!"
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/skylar_fantina_content/0/c-0/21/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Friendship!"
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/skylar_fantina_content/0/c-0/21/2/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Hate!"
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/skylar_fantina_content/0/c-0/21/c-0/7
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Fantina is extremely excited to skip right to her favorite part: showing her endless love for you!"
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/skylar_fantina_content/0/c-0/21/c-0/15
msgctxt "Skylar"
msgid "It's love!"
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/skylar_fantina_content/0/c-0/21/c-0/42 fantina_fan/skylar_fantina_content/0/c-0/21/c-1/42 fantina_fan/skylar_fantina_content/0/c-0/21/c-2/45
msgctxt "Skylar"
msgid "See you out there on the next one!"
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/skylar_fantina_content/0/c-0/21/c-1/7
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Fantina is extremely excited to skip right to her favorite part: sharing her endless friendship with you!"
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/skylar_fantina_content/0/c-0/21/c-1/15
msgctxt "Skylar"
msgid "Aww... friends forever."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/skylar_fantina_content/0/c-0/21/c-2/10
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Stunned, Fantina resigns herself to her least expected fate: your biggest fan now hates you."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/skylar_fantina_content/0/c-0/21/c-2/18
msgctxt "Skylar"
msgid "Enjoy your... hateship."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/skylar_fantina_content/0/c-0/21/c-2/75 fantina_fan/fantina_talk/0/c-1/15/c-0/31/g-0/88
msgctxt "Reggie"
msgid "Amazing! Brilliant! Superb work out there!"
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/skylar_fantina_content/0/c-0/21/c-2/83 fantina_fan/fantina_talk/0/c-1/15/c-0/31/g-0/96
msgctxt "Reggie"
msgid "You made your biggest fan into your worst enemy."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/skylar_fantina_content/0/c-0/21/c-2/91 fantina_fan/fantina_talk/0/c-1/15/c-0/31/g-0/104
msgctxt "Reggie"
msgid "Maybe I gotta start getting tips from you..."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/skylar_fantina_content/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Skylar"
msgid "Carry on, then!"
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter1/0/6
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "You've never been famous a day in your life, but as you try to evaluate the excitable figure blatantly staring at you, you can't help but wonder if perhaps this is how it feels."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter1/0/14
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "She looks at you like you've just announced she's won the lottery, her eyes wide and her jaw dropped."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter1/0/22
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "Oh. My. GOD. This can not be real!"
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter1/0/33
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "I must be dreaming, right?"
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter1/0/41
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "This is totally a dream. It has to be!"
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter1/0/49/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Probably"
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter1/0/50/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Wait, it is?"
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter1/0/51/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I too have trouble distinguishing my dreams from reality."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter1/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "Yes that’s it... That’s clearly the most logical explanation."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter1/0/g-0/8
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "Right now I’m comfortably asleep in my bed, zonked out on Am Bien, listening to the calming drone of my white noise machine."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter1/0/g-0/16
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "Because, this? This right here?"
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter1/0/g-0/24
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "There is absolutely no way on Earth this could actually be happening. Right?!"
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter1/0/g-0/32/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Believe it sister."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter1/0/g-0/33/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Depends what you think is happening."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter1/0/g-0/34/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I’m the wrong person to ask."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter1/0/g-0/c-3/7
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "Oh my God. It really IS YOU!"
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter1/0/g-0/c-4/7
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "I think you're actually here in the flesh, that's what!"
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter1/0/g-0/c-5/7
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "Haha, oh my god, you're even more hilarious in real life than I imagined!"
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter1/0/g-1/0
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "She turns away from you for a few moments, fanning at her face, but it doesn't help her calm down."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter1/0/g-1/5
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "I just can’t believe it!"
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter1/0/g-1/13
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "I mean you prepare your whole existence for something like this, but then y'know when it actually happens no amount of preparation could ever possibly be enough."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter1/0/g-1/21
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "I know people throw around the expression \"shaking, crying, and throwing up\" but y'know I think I might actually do it..."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter1/0/g-1/29/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Then let’s get you a paper bag!"
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter1/0/g-1/30/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Please don’t."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter1/0/g-1/31/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Why, are you sick or something?"
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter1/0/g-1/c-7/7
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "Wait did I say that out loud?!"
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter1/0/g-1/c-8/7
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "Only sick with <i>enthusiasm!</i>"
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter1/0/g-1/c-8/15
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "And maybe sick with some mild food poisoning, but that's totally unrelated."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter1/0/g-2/0
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "Ugh! I don’t know why I even said that! I’m so sorry..."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter1/0/g-2/11/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "It’s ok, really."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter1/0/g-3/0
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "It’s just that my heart’s racing a mile a minute, and there’s definitely not enough oxygen getting to my rotors."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter1/0/g-3/8
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "Which means I’m liable to blurt out just about any random thing that pops into my head."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter1/0/g-3/16
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "\"Taxidermy!\" \"Penicillin!\" \"Ontario!\""
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter1/0/g-3/24
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "Y'know see? Just like that!"
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter1/0/g-3/32
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "Oh, I’m so embarrassed..."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter1/0/g-3/40/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "There’s absolutely nothing to be embarrassed about."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter1/0/g-3/41/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "It’s not a big deal."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter1/0/g-3/42/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Have you considered medication?"
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter1/0/g-3/c-10/7
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "Are you kidding? I'm making a total fool of myself..."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter1/0/g-3/c-11/7
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "No, no I'm behaving like an out of control fan."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter1/0/g-3/c-12/7
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "I’ve considered a lot of things."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter1/0/g-4/0
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "I'm sorry. I really don’t mean to be overreacting like this."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter1/0/g-4/8
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "I just never thought we’d actually get the chance to interface like this."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter1/0/g-4/16
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "And now that it’s happening, I’m totally blowing it aren’t I..."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter1/0/g-4/24/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You haven’t blown anything."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter1/0/g-4/25/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "It’s ok. Everyone gets nervous sometimes."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter1/0/g-4/c-13/7
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "Really? You promise?"
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter1/0/g-4/c-14/7
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "Yeah? You get nervous too?"
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter1/0/g-4/c-14/15/0/s/0 fantina_fan/fantina_encounter1/0/g-5/16/s/0 fantina_fan/fantina_encounter2/0/g-16/32/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Absolutely."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter1/0/g-4/c-14/15/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Not me, no. I'm infallible."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter1/0/g-4/c-14/15/c-1/7
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "No disagreement here."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter1/0/g-5/0
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "Would you allow me the opportunity to just reset this whole interaction?"
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter1/0/g-5/8
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "So I have the chance to put my best blade forward?"
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter1/0/g-5/17/s/0 fantina_fan/fantina_encounter2/0/g-16/33/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Yeah sure whatever."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter1/0/g-5/c-15/7
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "Oh my God, you ARE the absolute best. Just like I always knew you would be."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter1/0/g-5/c-16/7
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "Thank you, thank you! I so, so appreciate it!"
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter1/0/g-5/c-16/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Make it fast? I got alotta objects I gotta bang."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter1/0/g-5/c-16/15/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I said 'yeah sure whatever' so... get goin'."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter1/0/g-6/0
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "Ok: here goes..."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter1/0/g-6/8
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "Hi there, I’m Fantina! And if it wasn’t painfully obvious from my over-the-top outburst a moment ago, I am your biggest fan."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter1/0/g-6/22/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Wow! That’s so cool!"
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter1/0/g-6/23/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Wait really?"
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter1/0/g-6/24/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Even bigger than my mom?"
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter1/0/g-6/c-17/7
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "Oh I'm so glad you feel that way!"
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter1/0/g-6/c-18/7
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "Uh huh!"
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter1/0/g-6/c-19/7
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "Well no one is going to be a bigger fan than your own mom, but y'know I'm happy to be in second place."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter1/0/g-7/6/0
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "I’ve been a huge admirer of yours since the second you brought me home from that discount electronics outlet all those years ago."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter1/0/g-7/6/8
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "Just everything about you is so unbelievably impressive. I’m constantly in total awe."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter1/0/g-7/6/16/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "That’s so sweet."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter1/0/g-7/6/17/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Wait, in awe of \"me\"?"
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter1/0/g-7/6/18/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "No way."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter1/0/g-8/0
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "It’s true! I’ve never known anyone so inspiring."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter1/0/g-8/8
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "The way you wash the dishes: making sure they’re sparkling clean even before you place them in the dishwasher."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter1/0/g-8/16
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "The way you adhere to a strict, daily routine: with every single minute pre-planned weeks in advance."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter1/0/g-8/24
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "The way you always file your taxes three months before they’re due. Oh!"
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter1/0/g-8/32
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "There truly aren’t words for how incredible you are."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter1/0/g-8/40/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Aww, thank you so much!"
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter1/0/g-8/41/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I am pretty incredible, aren’t I."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter1/0/g-8/42/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Thanks?"
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter1/0/g-8/43/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I definitely don't do those things."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter1/0/g-8/c-23/7
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "Of course! I just want you to know how absolutely inspiring you are."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter1/0/g-8/c-24/7
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "You’re beyond incredible. You're extraordinary!"
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter1/0/g-8/c-25/7
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "See? Even the way you express uncertainty is phenomenal!"
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter1/0/g-8/c-26/7
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "Right! I know that! And it's your commitment to the INTENTION of doing them that is the real art!"
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter1/0/g-9/0
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "You know, I really don’t want to bother you anymore than I already have. And..."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter1/0/g-9/8
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "I know your time is extremely valuable. But I was just wondering..."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter1/0/g-9/16
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "No, it’s so silly. Forget I ever said anything..."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter1/0/g-9/24/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Tell me!"
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter1/0/g-9/25/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Ok I’ll forget it."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter1/0/g-9/c-27/7
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "Well I was just wondering... if it’s not too much trouble..."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter1/0/g-9/c-28/7
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "Haha alright, since you twisted my arm..."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter1/0/g-10/0
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "Would you be willing to sign one of my blades?"
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter1/0/g-10/8
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "Just so I have something to remember this amazing moment by."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter1/0/g-10/16
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "Only if it’s not too much trouble though! I really don’t want to inconvenience you."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter1/0/g-10/24/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Of course!"
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter1/0/g-10/25/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Seems weird, but whatever."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter1/0/g-10/c-29/7
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "You take the permanent marker Fantina holds out to you and scrawl your signature along one of her blades."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter1/0/g-10/c-29/12
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "Oh boy... wow. That feels..."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter1/0/g-10/c-29/20
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "Really nice."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter1/0/g-10/c-29/31/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Glad you think so!"
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter1/0/g-10/c-29/31/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Okay..."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter1/0/g-10/c-29/31/c-0/7
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "Yummmm...."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter1/0/g-10/c-29/31/c-1/7
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "I need a breather..."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter1/0/g-11/0
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "Oh thank you so much! This is so amazing!"
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter1/0/g-11/8
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "And your handwriting is so immaculate! You are an artist with that pen."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter1/0/g-11/16
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "I didn’t realize I was in the presence of such a talented calligrapher."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter1/0/g-11/24/s/0 fantina_fan/fantina_encounter2/0/g-2/24/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You’re so sweet!"
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter1/0/g-11/25/s/0 fantina_fan/fantina_encounter2/0/g-2/25/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Thanks."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter1/0/g-11/26/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "That's 'cause you're not."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter1/0/g-11/c-31/7
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "I’m just being honest."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter1/0/g-11/c-32/7
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "You are so welcome!"
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter1/0/g-11/c-33/7
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "Stop being modest! You should design wedding stationary or tattoos or something!"
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter1/0/g-12/0
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "Wow. I can’t believe I actually got your signature."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter1/0/g-12/8
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "And emblazoned on my own body no less... Very naughty."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter1/0/g-12/16
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "I can’t wait to show this off to everyone else in the fan club."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter1/0/g-12/24
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "They’re going to be so unbelievably jealous I met you..."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter1/0/g-12/32/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Fan club?"
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter1/0/g-13/0
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "Wait you don’t know? I thought for sure you knew."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter1/0/g-13/8
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "Yeah, you have a fan club!"
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter1/0/g-13/16/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "That’s so cool!"
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter1/0/g-13/17/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Really? Why?"
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter1/0/g-13/18/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Are they also all oscillating fans?"
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter1/0/g-13/c-36/7
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "Because you’re incredible, silly!"
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter1/0/g-13/c-37/7
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "No, no they’re just fans of you!"
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter1/0/g-14/0
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "We actually have meet-ups every week."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter1/0/g-14/8
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "We talk about everything you’ve been up to at work - what new projects you’re developing - discuss your menu for the week. Sometimes there’s a raffle."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter1/0/g-14/16
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "There’s a very comprehensive agenda."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter1/0/g-14/24/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "That’s so unbelievably cool!"
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter1/0/g-14/25/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I had no idea."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter1/0/g-14/26/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "How’d everyone feel about Thursday’s lasagna?"
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter1/0/g-14/c-39/7
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "We don't like to advertise a lot. We only want to cater to the real, die-hard fans."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter1/0/g-14/c-39/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Makes sense."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter1/0/g-14/c-40/7
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "They were SO impressed. Gruyère was such an inspired choice."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter1/0/g-14/c-40/15
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "Maybe next time you should include some \"Fontina.\""
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter1/0/g-14/c-40/23
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "Get it? \"Fontina\" the cheese? It sounds like \"Fantina\" the fan?"
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter1/0/g-14/c-40/31
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "That's just a \"taste\" of the <i>hilarious</i> banter you can expect at the gatherings."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter1/0/g-14/c-40/39/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Oh, yeah, I get it all right."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter1/0/g-14/c-40/39/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Heh. That is pretty funny."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter1/0/g-14/c-40/39/c-0/7
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "Yayy!!!"
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter1/0/g-14/c-40/39/c-1/7
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "I knooooooowwwww!!!!"
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter1/0/g-15/0
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "Actually... we’re having our weekly meet-up real soon."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter1/0/g-15/8
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "And I would never want to impose or over-step - so please tell me if this seems inappropriate - but if you’re not super busy..."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter1/0/g-15/16/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Of course I’ll be there!"
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter1/0/g-15/17/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Let me think about it."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter1/0/g-15/c-41/7
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "Seriously?! You mean it?!"
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter1/0/g-15/c-41/15
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "That’s so unbelievably amazing of you!"
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter1/0/g-15/c-41/23
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "Oh I can’t wait to tell everyone!"
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter1/0/g-15/c-41/31
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "Thank you, thank you! I can’t wait!"
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter1/0/g-15/c-42/7
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "Thinking about it is all I could ever ask for."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter1/0/g-15/c-42/15
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "I really hope to see you back here then. And I promise it’ll be an incredible experience!"
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter1/0/g-15/c-42/23
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "And thanks so much for the autograph!"
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter2/0/6
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Fantina lets out an excited little shriek when she spots you, running over to greet you. You don't see anyone else around, but perhaps the other fan club members are just a little late..."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter2/0/11
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "You came!"
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter2/0/19
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "Oh my God!"
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter2/0/27
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "Ahhh!"
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter2/0/38
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "Ok, sorry sorry: I promise I’ll calm down."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter2/0/46
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "I’ve actually got some deep-breathing rotational exercises I’ve been practicing to appropriately handle this sort of situation."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter2/0/54
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "Don’t you worry, I’ll get my spindle system back under control ASAP."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter2/0/62/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Don’t worry, it’s very cute."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter2/0/63/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Honestly doesn’t faze me."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter2/0/64/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You’ve got thirty seconds."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter2/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "Even when I think I know every wonderful thing about you, you still manage to surprise me."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter2/0/c-0/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Stop you’re going to make me blush!"
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter2/0/c-0/15/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Yeah I am pretty dope."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter2/0/c-0/15/2/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Ok ok, my ego can’t take much more."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter2/0/c-0/15/c-0/7
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "Careful. You keep going on like that, and I... I swear I'll think you're flirting with me. And.."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter2/0/c-0/15/c-0/15
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "...I honestly don't know if my capacitor could take that."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter2/0/c-0/15/c-1/7
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "You are the absolute dopest. No argument here."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter2/0/c-0/15/c-2/7
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "Ok, I'll try my best to compliment you less."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter2/0/c-0/15/c-2/15
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "But that's going to be very, very difficult."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter2/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "And you are so incredibly understanding! Just another one of your exceptional qualities."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter2/0/c-2/7
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "It'll only take me twenty-nine, haha!"
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter2/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "And again my sincerest apologies. I just thought that the last time we met would be the highlight of my entire year..."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter2/0/g-0/8
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "But suddenly here you are again! It’s like I’m living in some sort of fantasy."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter2/0/g-0/16/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I have that effect on my fans."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter2/0/g-0/17/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Really, I’m just me."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter2/0/g-0/18/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Have you considered that you might be?"
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter2/0/g-0/c-3/7 fantina_fan/fantina_love_divert/0/0
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "You have no idea."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter2/0/g-0/c-4/7
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "You’re being much too modest."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter2/0/g-0/c-5/7
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "You're so funny! Have you considered stand-up comedy?"
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter2/0/g-0/c-5/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Once. Now I'm not allowed back in the Chortle Shack."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter2/0/g-0/c-5/15/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Naw. I'm not a dentist with a midlife crisis."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter2/0/g-0/c-5/15/c-0/7
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "Well I'd seriously consider it again. I'd come to every show and shower you with gifts."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter2/0/g-0/c-5/15/c-0/15
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "Oh which reminds me!"
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter2/0/g-0/c-5/15/c-1/7
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "Oh my goodness that could be your catchphrase!"
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter2/0/g-1/0
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "Since you’re here, this feels like as good a time as any to present you with..."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter2/0/g-1/8
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "...your exclusive fan meet-up welcome gift!"
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter2/0/g-1/19
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Fantina holds up something small and rectangular—you can't quite see what it is, and she keeps it facing away from you."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter2/0/g-1/24/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You got me a gift?!"
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter2/0/g-1/25/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "What’s the catch."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter2/0/g-1/26/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Is it cash? 'Cause my debt is suffocating..."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter2/0/g-1/c-6/7
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "Of course! You're our guest of honor today!"
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter2/0/g-1/c-7/7
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "There’s no catch!"
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter2/0/g-1/c-8/7
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "You’ll just have to open it and see!"
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter2/0/g-2/0
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "The fan club just wanted to express our immense and profound appreciation that you’d take the time out of your busy schedule to come and visit with us."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter2/0/g-2/8
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "We know you have some big shake-ups at work - and today’s usually laundry day - so it means so much that you still found the time."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter2/0/g-2/16
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "You really are the absolute best."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter2/0/g-2/26/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Eh, everyone’s got flaws."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter2/0/g-2/c-9/7
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "I'm just doing my best to compete with you."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter2/0/g-2/c-10/7
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "Don't thank me yet! Wait until you see your gift..."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter2/0/g-2/c-11/7
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "Everyone but you! You're absolutely flawless."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter2/0/g-3/0
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "So without further ado, may I present..."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter2/0/g-3/8
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "...your likeness crafted out of pasta!"
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter2/0/g-3/19
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "She turns your gift around to face you, and it's just as she said it was... a crude but sweet rendering of you in pasta."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter2/0/g-3/24
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "I hope you like it! I wasn’t sure if you were more of a rigatoni or penne fan: so I used both!"
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter2/0/g-3/32
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "With just a dappling of fettuccini."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter2/0/g-3/40/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "That’s amazing!"
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter2/0/g-3/41/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Am I supposed to eat it?"
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter2/0/g-3/42/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Can I date that too?"
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter2/0/g-3/c-13/7
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "Well, I’d personally prefer if you displayed it."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter2/0/g-3/c-13/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Seems unimaginative."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter2/0/g-3/c-13/15/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Can I display it and <i>then</i> eat it?"
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter2/0/g-3/c-13/15/c-1/7
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "I mean it's your gift so it's really up to you."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter2/0/g-3/c-14/7
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "I don’t think so. I think that violates some sort of law or something..."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter2/0/g-3/c-14/18/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Nuts."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter2/0/g-3/c-14/18/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Can't be doing that I guess..."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter2/0/g-3/c-14/18/2/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Never stopped me before!"
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter2/0/g-4/0
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "So what do you think? Do you like it?"
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter2/0/g-4/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "It’s exquisite."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter2/0/g-4/9/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "It’s very unique."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter2/0/g-4/10/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I can honestly say I’ve never received anything like it."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter2/0/g-5/0
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "Oh I’m so glad!"
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter2/0/g-5/11
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "It took me like eight hours to make. Which may seem like a lot, but pasta is actually an incredibly volatile medium."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter2/0/g-5/19
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "Michelangelo may have been a whiz with marble, but I’d like to see him try to sculpt something out of rigatoni!"
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter2/0/g-5/27/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Well it’s very sweet."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter2/0/g-5/28/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Yeah Michelangelo is definitely overrated."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter2/0/g-5/c-18/7
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "It warms my spindle to know how much you love it."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter2/0/g-5/c-19/7
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "Compared to you? Absolutely."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter2/0/g-6/3
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "Again, the fan club is just so incredibly appreciative that you stopped by."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter2/0/g-6/11
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "You take another look around but still fail to spot anyone else."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter2/0/g-6/16/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Question: is the rest of the fan club coming soon?"
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter2/0/g-7/0
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "Oh! Well actually... this is the fan club!"
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter2/0/g-7/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Very exclusive."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter2/0/g-7/9/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Wait it’s just you?"
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter2/0/g-7/10/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I only have ONE fan?!"
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter2/0/g-7/c-21/7
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "True, it is <i>very</i> exclusive... but..."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter2/0/g-7/c-22/7
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "Not exactly..."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter2/0/g-7/c-23/7
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "What? No! You have thousands of fans! All over the world! You should see the message boards."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter2/0/g-7/c-23/15
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "It's just difficult for them to all physically come to the meet-ups."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter2/0/g-7/c-23/23
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "What with air travel being so expensive and all."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter2/0/g-7/c-23/31
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "And regarding your more local fans..."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter2/0/g-8/0
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "Well, I suppose I should probably address the circulator in the room."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter2/0/g-8/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I’m listening..."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter2/0/g-8/9/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Yeah what the heck?"
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter2/0/g-8/10/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "If you must."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter2/0/g-8/c-24/7
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "Ok. But try to reserve judgement until you hear the entire story."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter2/0/g-8/c-25/7
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "I promise it will all make sense after I explain."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter2/0/g-8/c-26/7
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "I just think it's important for you to understand the context."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter2/0/g-9/0
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "The fan club WAS me and Gary. We’ve both been your biggest fans since literally like forever."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter2/0/g-9/8
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "And we used to share the job of orchestrating the fan meet-ups. To make sure no one would have to shoulder too much of the load."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter2/0/g-9/16/b/1
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "To make sure that nothing would clash with your Fantastic Red Shirt... big job."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter2/0/g-9/17/b/1
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "It’s a huge responsibility, you know?"
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter2/0/g-9/20/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Makes total sense."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter2/0/g-9/21/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Is it?"
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter2/0/g-9/c-28/7
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "You have no idea! It's a tremendously exhausting work load."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter2/0/g-9/c-28/15
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "Like planning a fancy wedding! Or a moon launch!"
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter2/0/g-9/c-28/23
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "Or a coffee date in Los Angeles."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter2/0/g-9/c-28/31/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "God that sounds horrific."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter2/0/g-9/c-28/31/1/s/0 fantina_fan/fantina_encounter4/0/g-2/26/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Uh huh."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter2/0/g-9/c-28/31/2/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You plan a lot of coffee dates in Los Angeles?"
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter2/0/g-9/c-28/31/c-1/7
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "You don't have to believe me, but it's true!"
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter2/0/g-9/c-28/31/c-2/7
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "Personally? No."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter2/0/g-9/c-28/31/c-2/15
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "But from what I've gathered on Placebook it seems like a nightmare."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter2/0/g-10/0
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "But recently Gary and I... well I guess you could say we’d been having clashes over the direction of the club."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter2/0/g-10/8
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "There were some new initiatives that I’d been championing, that he just wasn’t onboard with."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter2/0/g-10/16
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "And he’s obviously completely allowed to voice his opinions. I think that’s essential in democracy."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter2/0/g-10/24
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "But as your biggest fan, I just didn’t think that Gary really understood what this fan club was all about."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter2/0/g-10/32
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "So we opted to go our separate ways, and now it’s just me!"
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter2/0/g-10/40/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Completely understand."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter2/0/g-10/41/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Just like my mecha kaiju cinema club..."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter2/0/g-11/0
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "Wait... you’re disappointed, aren’t you?"
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter2/0/g-11/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Not at all!"
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter2/0/g-11/9/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Listen any fan club is still pretty cool in my book."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter2/0/g-11/10/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Well... I mean..."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter2/0/g-12/0
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "No it’s ok, I can totally tell."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter2/0/g-12/8
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "And why wouldn’t you be? I promised you this incredible, fantastic event worthy of your presence, and what did I deliver?"
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter2/0/g-12/16
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "Just me and a lame statue made of pasta that you can’t even eat or date."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter2/0/g-12/27
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "You probably don’t even like rigatoni! A real super fan would’ve known that!"
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter2/0/g-12/35/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "No I love rigatoni, promise!"
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter2/0/g-12/36/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I mean, pasta varieties are all essentially the same."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter2/0/g-12/37/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Look it’s not my fave, but I’ll deal."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter2/0/g-12/c-34/7
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "You’re just saying that to make me feel better..."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter2/0/g-12/c-35/7
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "And now I've got you saying absolutely crazy things just to try to spare my feelings..."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter2/0/g-12/c-36/7
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "But you shouldn't have to \"deal!\" I should be making you feel like you're the most important person in the entire world! Because you are!"
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter2/0/g-12/c-36/15
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "And instead I've just been a huge let down."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter2/0/g-13/0
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "I can’t believe I took you away from laundry day and wasted your time all for nothing."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter2/0/g-13/8
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "I’d be disappointed too. God, I’m so stupid..."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter2/0/g-13/16/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I don’t think you’re stupid at all!"
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter2/0/g-13/17/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Look it’s ok, we all make mistakes."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter2/0/g-13/18/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Only a little stupid though!"
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter2/0/g-13/c-37/7
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "But I am!"
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter2/0/g-13/c-38/7
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "You're so understanding. But I don't deserve your kindness..."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter2/0/g-13/c-39/7
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "You’re being much, much too kind."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter2/0/g-14/0
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "I just so desperately wanted to impress you, you know? After all, you’re so amazing and incredible."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter2/0/g-14/8
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "And I wanted you to know how special I think you are."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter2/0/g-14/16
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "How I’d do anything to make you understand how much you mean to me."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter2/0/g-14/24/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I promise I still think you’re great."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter2/0/g-14/25/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Water under the bridge."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter2/0/g-14/26/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I really don’t care."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter2/0/g-14/c-40/7
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "Really? In spite of everything? In spite of the rigatoni?"
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter2/0/g-14/c-40/15/0/s/0 fantina_fan/fantina_encounter3/0/g-16/27/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Yes."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter2/0/g-14/c-40/15/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Maybe not everything."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter2/0/g-14/c-40/15/2/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I promise I don't care about the rigatoni."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter2/0/g-14/c-40/15/c-1/7
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "Listen I'll take whatever I can get!"
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter2/0/g-14/c-42/7
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "See and that's what I admire most about you. You're so forgiving."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter2/0/g-15/0
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "Let me make it up to you!"
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter2/0/g-15/8
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "I don’t want to overpromise, but remember the initiative that Gary and I butted heads about?"
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter2/0/g-15/16/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Of course."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter2/0/g-15/17/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Yeah that was literally two minutes ago."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter2/0/g-15/18/s/0 fantina_fan/fantina_encounter3/0/g-16/25/s/0 fantina_fan/fantina_encounter4/0/g-6/42/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "No."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter2/0/g-15/c-45/7
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "Ahahaha! You are <i>so</i> funny."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter2/0/g-16/0
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "Well I’ve been waiting for the opportune moment to reveal that project, but I think now is the right time."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter2/0/g-16/8
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "So if you’d be willing to give me one more chance and come to the next meet-up, I’d love to unveil it for you."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter2/0/g-16/16
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "I know it’s an imposition, but it’d mean the world to me."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter2/0/g-16/24
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "Would you consider coming? For me?"
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter2/0/g-16/34/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I’ll think about it."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter2/0/g-16/c-46/7
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "Every time I don't think you could be any more awesome, you go and exceed all my expectations!"
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter2/0/g-16/c-47/7
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "Oh thank you, thank you!"
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter2/0/g-16/c-48/7
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "After how I've behaved, that is all I can ask for."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter2/0/g-16/c-48/15
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "But I really hope you'll give me one last chance."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter2/0/g-17/0
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "I promise, it’ll be an experience you’ll never forget. I hope to see you soon!"
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter3/0/6
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "You came! I can’t believe it!"
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter3/0/14
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "I’m so sorry... look at me immediately getting all emotional. Blubbering and falling apart like some sort of lovesick idiot."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter3/0/22
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "<i>Pull yourself together Fantina; you’re embarrassing yourself in front of your hero!</i>"
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter3/0/30/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You’re not embarrassing; you’re great!"
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter3/0/31/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Here’s a tissue. Use it."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter3/0/32/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "All good! Lemme just grab my pepper spray..."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter3/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "Gosh you're always so understanding! It makes me want to cry!"
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter3/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "Always so emotionally supportive. You're incredible."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter3/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "I’m sorry, I really don’t mean to be so emotional. I know it’s too much."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter3/0/g-0/8
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "It’s just that after our last interaction I really thought I’d blown things with you for good. That we’d never have the chance to see each other again."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter3/0/g-0/16
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "And that’s not how I wanted things to end between us."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter3/0/g-0/24/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Me either."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter3/0/g-0/25/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Well, let’s just take a deep breath and reset."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter3/0/g-0/c-3/7
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "I'm so glad you feel the same way."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter3/0/g-0/c-3/15
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "I'd just fall to pieces if you didn't want to hang out anymore."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter3/0/g-1/0
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "Because sure, I'd get to see you dozens of times a day on social media."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter3/0/g-1/8
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "And when you’d go out to get coffee at that little bistro down the block."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter3/0/g-1/16
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "And when you're asleep between the hours of midnight and 9am."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter3/0/g-1/24
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "But none of that’s really the same, you know?"
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter3/0/g-1/32
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "Sure I’d be seeing YOU, but how can we be really seeing each other if I’m \"wearing a disguise,\" or \"hiding in some bushes.\""
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter3/0/g-1/40/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I’m sorry, you did what?"
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter3/0/g-1/41/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Wait you can leave the house?"
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter3/0/g-1/42/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Haha. You’re kidding right? <i>Right?</i>"
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter3/0/g-1/c-5/7
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "Listen that's all in the past."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter3/0/g-1/c-6/7
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "Let’s not focus on that."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter3/0/g-2/0
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "What’s important is that you’re here: now!"
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter3/0/g-2/8
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "You did come back! Because you’re such an incredible person."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter3/0/g-2/16
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "I can’t believe I ever doubted you."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter3/0/g-2/24/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Listen I’m really not that great..."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter3/0/g-2/25/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Good. You shouldn't have."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter3/0/g-2/c-8/7
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "And always being so modest."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter3/0/g-3/0
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "I just wanted to say, from the bottom of my heart, thank you for being willing to give me one more chance. Even if I don’t really deserve it."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter3/0/g-3/8
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "I recognize that I’ve been overly emotional - probably too sensitive - and let’s face it: more than a little clingy."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter3/0/g-3/16/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "It’s all good."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter3/0/g-3/17/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Plastic wrap is \"clingy.\""
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter3/0/g-3/18/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You left me 207 voicemails. My phone exploded."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter3/0/g-3/c-12/7
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "I know I'm sorrrryyy."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter3/0/g-4/0
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "Yet despite all my endless shortcomings, you still came back."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter3/0/g-4/8
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "It’s such a powerful testament to the incredibly patient and generous person you are."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter3/0/g-4/16
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "That’s why everyone loves you."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter3/0/g-4/24/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Really I’m super average..."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter3/0/g-4/25/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "My parents don’t even like me that much!"
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter3/0/g-4/26/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Fantina. I don’t like you."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter3/0/g-4/c-13/7
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "So untrue! Never put yourself down like that."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter3/0/g-4/c-14/7
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "Of course they do! Everyone does!"
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter3/0/g-4/c-15/7
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "And you’re hilarious too! I completely forgot about that!"
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter3/0/g-5/0
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "And listen, I’ve been giving this a lot of thought..."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter3/0/g-5/8
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "But after today’s surprise unveiling I plan on stepping down as Supreme Executive Presidential Leader of your fan club."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter3/0/g-5/16/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Oh no! That’s too bad. I’m so sorry to hear that."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter3/0/g-5/17/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Yeah that’s probably a good idea."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter3/0/g-5/18/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Because you finally realize I’m not that special?"
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter3/0/g-5/c-17/7
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "Oh I absolutely agree."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter3/0/g-5/c-18/7
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "Actually it’s BECAUSE I know you’re that special."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter3/0/g-6/0
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "No matter how much I may value that office, I have disgraced it with my shameful behavior. And that’s just not fair to you."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter3/0/g-6/8
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "You deserve someone in the position of Supreme Executive Presidential Leader who will always put your needs and desires above their own."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter3/0/g-6/16
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "That’s the job."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter3/0/g-6/24/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Well, I’m just glad you’ve come to that realization."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter3/0/g-6/25/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "What job? There’s NO fan club!"
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter3/0/g-6/26/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You know maybe this would be a good opportunity to disband the whole fan club idea?"
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter3/0/g-6/c-20/7
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "Well there certainly won’t be one without proper leadership. That's for sure."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter3/0/g-6/c-21/7
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "Let’s not be hasty, you deserve the best fan club possible."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter3/0/g-7/0
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "But let’s not dwell on that for now."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter3/0/g-7/8
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "I asked you here, because today is meant to be a celebration! A celebration of the endless joy you’ve brought to my life, and to the entire world."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter3/0/g-7/16/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I appreciate that but..."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter3/0/g-7/17/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Isn’t that a little hyperbolic?"
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter3/0/g-7/18/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Oh shoot, you know I totally forgot my dermatology appointment!"
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter3/0/g-7/c-23/7
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "No I don’t think so."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter3/0/g-7/c-24/11
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "Oh don’t worry, that’s next week. I checked your calendar."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter3/0/g-8/0
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "So without any further ado, may I present to you..."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter3/0/g-8/8
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "The Hallowed Sanctuary of Eternal Reverence!"
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter3/0/g-8/19/3
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Fantina steps to the side, revealing a small table you'd failed to notice prior. Candles illuminate an extensive collection of what appears to be your garbage, hair, and nail clippings."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter3/0/g-8/19/8
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "Do you like it? It’s a shrine I built in dedication to you!"
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter3/0/g-8/19/16/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "It’s so... personal."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter3/0/g-8/19/18/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I hate it."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter3/0/g-8/19/c-25/7
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "I’m glad you noticed!"
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter3/0/g-8/19/c-26/13
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "You’re speechless! I knew you’d love it!"
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter3/0/g-8/19/c-27/7
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "Haha, there is that trademark sense of humor again!"
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter3/0/g-10/0
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "And here Gary thought it would be an extremely inappropriate gesture and \"weird you out.\" That instead of coming off as an affectionate tribute, it crossed the line from fan into \"stalker territory.\""
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter3/0/g-10/8
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "But I knew he was wrong, and I told him as much."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter3/0/g-10/16
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "Frankly, Gary was always wrong about a lot of things. He just doesn’t know you like I do."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter3/0/g-10/24/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Apparently not."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter3/0/g-11/0
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "Can I tell you about it?"
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter3/0/g-11/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I think I’ve got the gist."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter3/0/g-11/9/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Can I stop you? Haha."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter3/0/g-11/10/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Please no."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter3/0/g-11/c-29/7
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "Oh but there’s so many details I need to explain!"
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter3/0/g-11/c-31/7
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "Ok, I get it. You’re good at sarcasm. Now pipe down while I explain."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter3/0/g-12/0
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "The Hallowed Sanctuary of Eternal Reverence was constructed as a holy shrine to your glory and benevolence. To spread the light of your truth to all the peoples of the Earth. To make everyone feel as loved as you’ve made me feel."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter3/0/g-12/8
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "That’s why there’s an open flame in the middle of it."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter3/0/g-12/16
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "It burns eternally as my love for you burns eternally."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter3/0/g-12/24/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Oh wow. That’s great, haha."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter3/0/g-12/25/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Isn’t that a fire hazard?"
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter3/0/g-12/26/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Are we almost done here, Fantina?"
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter3/0/g-12/c-32/7
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "I knew you'd think so!"
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter3/0/g-12/c-33/7
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "Only if a jilted crush wanted to harm you."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter3/0/g-12/c-33/15
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "But you'd have to be really stupid to wind up in that situation."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter3/0/g-12/c-34/7
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "Oh we’re just getting started!"
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter3/0/g-13/0
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "And of course the most important part of any shrine is the sacred relics. And I’ve gathered these sacred relics from all across the house."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter3/0/g-13/8
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "There’s the floss you threw away last Friday... and some very cute toenails..."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter3/0/g-13/16
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "Oh! And there’s a pile of your hair clippings from when you gave yourself that haircut last month."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter3/0/g-13/24
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "I really thought that you should’ve sprung for a real barber, but who am I to argue with someone as enlightened as you?"
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter3/0/g-13/32/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "How wonderful."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter3/0/g-13/34/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Are you absolutely sure my dermatologist is next week?"
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter3/0/g-13/c-35/7
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "Is that... sarcastic?"
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter3/0/g-13/c-35/15/0/s/0 fantina_fan/fantina_encounter3/0/g-13/c-37/38/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "What? No!"
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter3/0/g-13/c-35/15/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Yup."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter3/0/g-13/c-37/11
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "Yes I told you I checked your calendar."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter3/0/g-13/c-37/19
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "Why are you so obsessed with this dermatologist anyway?"
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter3/0/g-13/c-37/27
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "Is there something going on between you two?"
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter3/0/g-13/c-37/38/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Just some light dermatology."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter3/0/g-13/c-37/38/c-1/7
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "Then why are you so eager to leave?"
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter3/0/g-14/0
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "Oh I see... so you don’t like this either? Is that it?"
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter3/0/g-14/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "What? No! It’s... comprehensive!"
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter3/0/g-14/9/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Yeah not really."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter3/0/g-14/10/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I’ve been saying that!"
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter3/0/g-14/c-38/7
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "Of course it is! It's extremely comprehensive! But you still don't appreciate it!"
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter3/0/g-14/c-40/7
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "Unbelievable!"
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter3/0/g-15/3
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "You know I really don’t know what I’m supposed to do to please you."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter3/0/g-15/11
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "I create a fan club for you. I exile Gary for his heretical views. I craft you a statue made out of macaroni. I build you the Hallowed Sanctuary of Eternal Reverence for crying out loud!"
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter3/0/g-15/19
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "But nothing that I do is ever good enough for you is it?"
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter3/0/g-15/30/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "It’s not you!"
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter3/0/g-15/31/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Yeah but I liked Gary! Maybe too much."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter3/0/g-15/32/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Nope."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter3/0/g-16/0
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "Look. I’m not going to drag this out. I’ve got more self-respect than that."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter3/0/g-16/8
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "So I’m just going to ask you here and now..."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter3/0/g-16/16
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "Do you feel as strongly about me as I feel about you?"
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter3/0/g-16/24/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "No!"
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter3/0/g-16/26/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Yes?"
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_love_path/0
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "Well, that honestly makes a lot of sense..."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_love_path/8
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "Although... all strong relationships go through rough patches. Ultimately isn’t that what makes them strong?"
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_love_path/16
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "And frankly, because of this little kerfuffle I know we’ll grow even closer than we ever would have otherwise. In that way, this has all been a blessing in disguise hasn’t it?"
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_love_path/27
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "Oh how wonderful! And in celebration: I’m going to reinstate myself as Supreme Executive Presidential Leader of your fan club."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_love_path/35 fantina_fan/fantina_yes_path/19
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "After all, someone has to start putting together next week’s meet-up."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_yes_path/0
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "Oh! Great!!"
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_yes_path/11
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "In celebration: I’m going to reinstate myself as Supreme Executive Presidential Leader of your fan club."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_love_return/0/0
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "You're back! I lerv ya!"
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_love_return/0/11
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "That's my way of saying I love you without being too creepy!"
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_love_return/0/19/s/0 fantina_fan/fantina_talk/0/c-0/23/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Great!"
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_love_return/0/20/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Fantina, can we talk about our relationship?"
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_love_return/0/21/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Actually... I'm ready to Realize my biggest fan!"
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_love_return/0/c-0/10
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "See you tomorrow."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_love_return/0/c-0/18
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "...and in my dreams."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_love_return/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "Uh oh! Sounds bad...?"
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_love_return/0/c-1/19/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "It's not bad... it's just..."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_love_return/0/c-1/19/c-0/7
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "Sounds really bad."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_love_return/0/c-1/19/c-0/18
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "Lalalala!! Gotta go!"
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter4/0/6
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "My darling! My bae! My sun and my moon."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter4/0/17
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "My everything!"
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter4/0/25
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "You came back..."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter4/0/33/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "For some reason, haha."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter4/0/34/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Yep."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter4/0/35/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I did!"
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter4/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "Always so hilarious! Your meme game must be top notch!"
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter4/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "Such a stoic demeanor; it's so intoxicating!"
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter4/0/c-1/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Yes, but only to talk."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter4/0/c-1/15/c-0/7
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "That’s great! Talking to you is my favorite pastime in the world."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter4/0/c-2/7
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "You did hahahaha! So funny!"
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter4/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "I’ve got to admit, I was a little worried there for awhile."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter4/0/g-0/8
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "Even though we’re in a committed relationship now, you hadn’t called - or texted - or responded to my incessant wailing."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter4/0/g-0/16
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "I was really starting to worry that we’d only see each other every other hour."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter4/0/g-0/27
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "And that’s clearly not enough time together, don’t you agree?"
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter4/0/g-0/35/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You know, I think that’s a healthy amount of time."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter4/0/g-0/36/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Every other hour seems plenty."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter4/0/g-0/37/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "About the wailing: the neighbors have started to complain."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter4/0/g-0/c-3/7
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "Oh it's very healthy, I agree. But I think it could be even healthier!"
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter4/0/g-0/c-4/7
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "Well we can start there and increase our togetherness quota over time."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter4/0/g-0/c-5/7
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "Let them complain! I want everyone to know how much I love you!"
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter4/0/g-1/0
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "Anyway, you’ve come back just in time!"
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter4/0/g-1/8
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "I was just making plans for us to visit my parents in Albuquerque for Hanksgiving."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter4/0/g-1/16
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "Do you want to leave Tuesday or Wednesday evening?"
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter4/0/g-1/24
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "Travel will obviously be more hectic on Wednesday since it’s the night before and all, but I wasn’t sure if you’d be able to take Tuesday off?"
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter4/0/g-1/32/s/0 fantina_fan/fantina_encounter4/0/g-1/c-7/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You have parents?"
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter4/0/g-1/33/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Hanksgiving isn’t for months!"
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter4/0/g-1/c-7/7
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "Right? But my parents get very anxious if you leave things to the last minute."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter4/0/g-2/0
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "Of course I do, silly! They’re great, you’re going to love them."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter4/0/g-2/8
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "They look like this!"
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter4/0/g-2/19
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Fantina holds up a photo of two fans, a ceiling fan and a small desk fan dangling dangerously by its cord from one of the ceiling fan's blades."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter4/0/g-2/24/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Sure..."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter4/0/g-2/25/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Ok."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter4/0/g-2/27/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "They're beautiful."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter4/0/g-2/c-11/7
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "It's where I got my good looks!"
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter4/0/g-3/0
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "Although, annoyingly, they didn’t believe me when I said I was actually in love with you."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter4/0/g-3/11 fantina_fan/fantina_encounter4/0/g-4/22
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "Can you believe that?"
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter4/0/g-3/19
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "Just because I’d already told them that on several other occasions when we weren’t actually officially lovers."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter4/0/g-3/27
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "It’s called \"manifesting\" mom: look it up!"
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter4/0/g-3/38
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "You believe in the power of manifesting, don’t you?"
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter4/0/g-3/46/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I used to. But lately what I’m trying to manifest isn’t working."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter4/0/g-3/47/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I think it’s hogwash."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter4/0/g-3/48/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "No. I want to talk about something else..."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter4/0/g-3/c-12/7
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "Don’t worry! We can manifest it together!"
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter4/0/g-3/c-12/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'm not sure we can."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter4/0/g-3/c-13/7
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "Right? I agree. Totally bogus."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter4/0/g-3/c-14/7
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "That’s ok, no couple agrees on everything!"
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter4/0/g-4/0
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "Anyway, they said that I was delusional. The nerve!"
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter4/0/g-4/11
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "And then they said that even if we were dating it’d be a huge mistake."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter4/0/g-4/19/b/1
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "I mean how could it be a mistake with you in that <i>Fantastic Red Shirt... </i> right?"
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter4/0/g-4/30/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I can, actually."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter4/0/g-4/31/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Your parents seem very wise. And plastic."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter4/0/g-4/32/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "It is a huge mistake."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter4/0/g-4/c-15/7
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "Listen, you don’t have to stand up for them on my account."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter4/0/g-4/c-16/7
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "They’re so full of it."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter4/0/g-4/c-17/7
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "Oh they make me so mad I swear I can't even hear when others around here are talking to me!"
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter4/0/g-5/0
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "They literally said it’d be a mistake for us to date, because I don’t know the real you, it's just a fantasy version I already made up in my head long before we ever met."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter4/0/g-5/8
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "But they’re just ceiling fans so what do they know about true love."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter4/0/g-5/16/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "But you don’t really know me."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter4/0/g-5/17/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I heard ceiling fans are known for their insight!"
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter4/0/g-5/c-18/7
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "What do you mean? I know you inside and out."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter4/0/g-5/c-18/15
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "And the inside part was much harder to know because I had to get access to your medical records."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter4/0/g-5/c-18/23
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "And believe me that was NOT easy."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter4/0/g-5/c-18/31/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I’m sorry, what now?"
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter4/0/g-5/c-18/31/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "That information’s private! And disgusting!"
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter4/0/g-5/c-18/31/2/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "So that’s why my hospital said I’d been hacked!"
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter4/0/g-5/c-19/7
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "Yeah? Where'd you hear that?"
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter4/0/g-5/c-19/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Social media."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter4/0/g-5/c-19/15/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I told myself. While I was sleeping. I talk in my sleep."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter4/0/g-5/c-19/15/2/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "My old professor, Dr. Randy Professorson."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter4/0/g-5/c-19/15/c-0/7
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "But I hacked into your social media and I didn't see anything mentioning that."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter4/0/g-5/c-19/15/c-0/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'm sorry, what?"
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter4/0/g-5/c-19/15/c-1/7
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "But I watch you sleeping all the time and I've never heard you talk in your sleep."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter4/0/g-5/c-19/15/c-1/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Wait seriously?"
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter4/0/g-5/c-19/15/c-2/7
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "But Dr. Randy Professorson has been in a coma since 2009."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter4/0/g-5/c-19/15/c-2/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Are you spying on me?"
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter4/0/g-6/0
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "Look I’m sorry!"
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter4/0/g-6/8
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "If I crossed a line it’s just because I so desperately wanted to know every facet of you."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter4/0/g-6/16
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "Every single, fascinating detail."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter4/0/g-6/24
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "And so tell me this: if I know everything about you - and I still love you - then how can anyone say I don’t actually know you?"
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter4/0/g-6/32
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "I know everything, right?"
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter4/0/g-6/40/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "We'd probably need to conduct a rigorous test."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter4/0/g-6/41/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Idk, there's a <i>lotta</i> repressed memories in here."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter4/0/g-7/0
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "Seriously?"
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter4/0/g-7/8
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "I don’t see how you can say that."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter4/0/g-7/16
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "I’m starting to think that maybe you don’t actually want to be in a relationship with me..."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter4/0/g-7/24/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I don’t."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter4/0/g-7/25/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Wow you catch on fast!"
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter4/0/g-7/c-23/7
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "Why are you lying to me?!"
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter4/0/g-7/c-24/7
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "I don’t know why you’re acting this way... Being so mean..."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter4/0/g-8/0
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "This isn’t like you at all..."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter4/0/g-8/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "No see, it’s exactly like me!"
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter4/0/g-9/0
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "Huh. I see."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter4/0/g-9/8
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "So you’re saying... the real you is different than the version of you that I thought I knew?"
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter4/0/g-9/16/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Yes! Exactly!"
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter4/0/g-9/17/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Ding ding ding!"
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter4/0/g-9/18/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "We are all unknown to ourselves. That's just philosophy and stuff."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter4/0/g-10/0
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "Wow. That’s... that’s... so..."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter4/0/g-10/8
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "...incredibly insightful!"
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter4/0/g-10/19
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "Like, I always knew you were smart, but I had no idea you had such intuitive instincts about deep-level psychology."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter4/0/g-10/27
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "You’re even more incredible than I thought you were!"
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter4/0/g-10/35/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Damnit!"
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter4/0/g-10/36/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "We were so close..."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter4/0/g-10/37/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Hell yeah I am."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_friend_path/0
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "-but, you’re also kind of a jerk. Which I never knew."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_friend_path/11
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "That’s not something that really comes across in your carefully crafted public persona."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_friend_path/19
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "And, to be quite honest, I don’t think I really like that about you."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_friend_path/27
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "I mean, I’ve done so many amazing things to show you how deeply I care about you... and you’ve coldly rejected all of them."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_friend_path/35
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "Like, don’t get me wrong, I’m still a fan of yours..."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_friend_path/43
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "But after how you’ve treated me I don’t think I’m interested in being your number one fan anymore."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_friend_path/51
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "I hope you understand."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_friend_return/0/0
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "We are friends!"
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_friend_return/0/8
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "See? ...I can learn."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_friend_return/0/16/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Great, 'cause there's gonna be a test later."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_friend_return/0/17/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Don't you wanna rummage through my garbage?"
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_friend_return/0/18/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Honestly, I don't think this feels like real friendship."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_friend_return/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "I'll see you later, my companion within the household."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_friend_return/0/c-0/15 fantina_fan/fantina_friend_return/0/c-1/15
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "The conversation with your friend ends as quickly as it began."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_friend_return/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "Nope. This is feeling a lot more like the right call."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_friend_return/0/c-2/7
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "Wha."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_friend_return/0/c-2/15
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "That's... not cool."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_friend_return/0/c-2/27
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "If it's not love... then it's what?"
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_friend_return/0/c-2/35
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "Scratch that. I don't even want to know."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_friend_return/0/c-2/43
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "And with that, she is gone."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter5/0/6
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "Oh hey. Didn’t expect to see you around here again."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter5/0/14/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Me neither."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter5/0/15/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Honestly I think I might be lost."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter5/0/16/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I’m just looking for my wallet, have you seen it?"
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter5/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "In your own house?"
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter5/0/c-1/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "The layout is surprisingly confusing. I have two bathroom doors on this floor..."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter5/0/c-2/7
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "Sorry, I haven’t."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter5/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "Well you’re just in time for the official last meeting of your fan club."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter5/0/g-0/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Really? Oh no!"
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter5/0/g-0/9/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "That’s probably a good idea."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter5/0/g-0/10/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "So soon? What is this, a Streamflix series?"
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter5/0/g-1/0
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "Yeah I’m shutting it down."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter5/0/g-1/8
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "Abdicating my position, tearing down the shrine and everything."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter5/0/g-1/16
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "Honestly, it really hasn’t been the same since Gary left."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter5/0/g-1/24
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "And truthfully I wasn’t really feeling it anymore, ya know?"
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter5/0/g-1/32/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Why’re you shuttering it?"
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter5/0/g-2/0
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "Well it was super easy to be ecstatic about the fictional version of you."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter5/0/g-2/8
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "That person was so cool! Just exploding with every hyperbolic, positive trait a human could possibly possess."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter5/0/g-2/16
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "That person was frickin’ awesome."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter5/0/g-2/24/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I dunno, that does sound a lot like me."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter5/0/g-2/25/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Yeah maybe that’s a slight exaggeration."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter5/0/g-2/c-7/7
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "I'm not so sure anymore..."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter5/0/g-2/c-8/7
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "Honestly, in my opinion, it's more than just a \"slight exaggeration.\""
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter5/0/g-3/0
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "In fact, the more time I’ve spent around the real you, the more I’ve realized you’re not like the person I made up in my head."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter5/0/g-3/8
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "Not at all."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter5/0/g-3/16
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "I bet your favorite sport isn’t even cheese rolling is it?"
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter5/0/g-3/24/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I have no idea what the hell that is."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter5/0/g-3/25/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I loathe cheese rolling."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter5/0/g-3/26/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Cheese rolling is only my <i>second</i> favorite sport."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter5/0/g-3/c-9/7
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "I should've figured."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter5/0/g-3/c-10/7
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "You're really missing out. It's wildly entertaining."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter5/0/g-3/c-10/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "What do you do?"
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter5/0/g-3/c-10/15/c-0/7
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "You roll the cheese. Obviously."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter5/0/g-3/c-11/7
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "See I've been wrong this entire time."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter5/0/g-4/0
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "What is your favorite sport anyway?"
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter5/0/g-4/8
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "I realize I don’t even know."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter5/0/g-4/16/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I lied: it actually IS cheese rolling!"
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter5/0/g-4/17/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Actually my favorite sport is Hornussen. It’s Swiss!"
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter5/0/g-4/18/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Anything involving sports makes me nauseous."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter5/0/g-4/c-12/7
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "Ah see I didn't even think you were a jokester like that!"
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter5/0/g-4/c-13/7
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "Huh."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter5/0/g-4/c-13/15
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "Ya know, I never would’ve guess that."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter5/0/g-4/c-14/7
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "Honestly me too... Dunk gets me all confused sometimes."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter5/0/g-5/0
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "I guess there’s a lot about you I probably don’t know."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter5/0/g-5/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "That’s true."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter5/0/g-5/9/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Naw the only thing you got wrong was the cheese rolling."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter5/0/g-5/10/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Is it ever possible to \"really\" know another?"
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter5/0/g-5/c-15/7
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "It really makes me re-evaluate a lot of my previous assumptions..."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter5/0/g-5/c-16/7
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "I mean if I was wrong about the cheese rolling, who knows what else I've been wrong about."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter5/0/g-5/c-17/7
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "That's a great philosophical question. I'm not sure."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter5/0/g-6/0
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "You know, maybe this is a little forward... especially after how I’ve been acting..."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter5/0/g-6/8
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "But would you like to just hang out some time?"
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter5/0/g-6/16
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "I know I kind of blew a relationship with the fictional you... but I’d still like to know more about the real you."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter5/0/g-6/24
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "That is, if you’d give me the opportunity?"
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter5/0/g-6/32/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Sure, I've got nothing better to do!"
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter5/0/g-6/33/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I would be honored."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter5/0/g-6/c-18/7
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "Ha! You could stand to use a little of my old excitement."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter5/0/g-7/0
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "Thanks."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter5/0/g-7/8
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "Ya know, I thought I’d be really bummed to lose the fictional you."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter5/0/g-7/16
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "But honestly, I’m kinda excited to get to know the real you."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter5/0/g-7/24
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "And who knows, maybe that human deserves a fan club too."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter6/0/0
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "Hey you."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter6/0/8
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "I've been thinking back on all the things that you said."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter6/0/16
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "Thinking, and reading. I have all of them written down on my blade."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter6/0/24
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "...next to your autograph."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter6/0/32
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "And I have more than enough to think about."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter6/0/40
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "How are you?"
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter6/0/48/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Can we talk about you, Fantina?"
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter6/0/49/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'm doing okay - just popping in to say hi."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter6/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "Really?"
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter6/0/c-0/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Yes. I want to hear about you."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter6/0/c-0/15/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "All this time we've talked about me. What's your story?"
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter6/0/c-0/15/g-0/0
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "Funny. I'm not used to talking about myself."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter6/0/c-0/15/g-0/8
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "I feel, really... awkward."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter6/0/c-0/15/g-0/16
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "<w>Whoa... whoa!</w>"
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter6/0/c-0/15/g-0/27
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "<w>I'm spinning... help!!</w>"
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter6/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "Well then... hi."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_encounter6/0/c-1/15
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "Come back soon, all right?"
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_talk/0/0
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "I... uh..."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_talk/0/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Let's start slow... What's your name?"
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_talk/0/9/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "C'mon. This is silly."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_talk/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "Fantina Fantastico."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_talk/0/c-0/15
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "I'm a pedestal fan with oscillating capabilities."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_talk/0/c-0/23/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Not bad."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_talk/0/c-0/23/g-0/0
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "I enjoy cooling, dancing, and..."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_talk/0/c-0/23/g-0/8
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "...and ICE CREAM!"
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_talk/0/c-0/23/g-0/19/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Ice cream!"
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_talk/0/c-0/23/g-0/19/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "That's the spirit!"
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_talk/0/c-0/23/g-0/19/g-0/0
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "I never talk about ice cream... but it feels really nice to."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_talk/0/c-0/23/g-0/19/g-0/8
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "It's making me think..."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_talk/0/c-0/23/g-0/19/g-0/16
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "I'm used to focusing on others, rather than myself. Day in, day out, I blast my feelings out into the world, when..."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_talk/0/c-0/23/g-0/19/g-0/24
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "I could do with a little more inward reflection."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_talk/0/c-0/23/g-0/19/g-0/32/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You're pretty good at this."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_talk/0/c-0/23/g-0/19/g-0/32/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Take it home, Fantina."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_talk/0/c-0/23/g-0/19/g-0/32/g-0/0
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "I'm... I'm worth it!"
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_talk/0/c-0/23/g-0/19/g-0/32/g-0/11
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "I'm worth affection... and attention... and love!"
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_talk/0/c-0/23/g-0/19/g-0/32/g-0/19/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "That's it!"
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_talk/0/c-0/23/g-0/19/g-0/32/g-0/19/c-0/7
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "Phew. I think that's enough for one day."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_talk/0/c-0/23/g-0/19/g-0/32/g-0/19/c-0/15
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "Thank you."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_talk/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "What? No. I'm trying, I swear!"
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_talk/0/c-1/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You should be better at this by now."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_talk/0/c-1/15/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Sorry... let me try again..."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_talk/0/c-1/15/c-0/7
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "I... I... I..."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_talk/0/c-1/15/c-0/15
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "I just started reflecting back on myself rather than blowing everything away from me."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_talk/0/c-1/15/c-0/23
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "It's not an easy transition to make!"
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_talk/0/c-1/15/c-0/31/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You're weak."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_talk/0/c-1/15/c-0/31/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Just tell me something about you that's real!"
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_talk/0/c-1/15/c-0/31/g-0/0
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "No... no!"
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_talk/0/c-1/15/c-0/31/g-0/11
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Fantina sways, then topples to the ground with a cry."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_talk/0/c-1/15/c-0/31/g-0/19
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "Now you've done it."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_talk/0/c-1/15/c-0/31/g-0/27
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "I thought it would never happen. I thought I would never do this."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_talk/0/c-1/15/c-0/31/g-0/38
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "But you..."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_talk/0/c-1/15/c-0/31/g-0/46
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "I hate you."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_sorter/0/0
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "Thanks for letting me talk the other day. It felt really good!"
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_sorter/0/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Glad to hear it!"
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_sorter/0/9/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "So do you have something to say to me?"
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_sorter/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "I want to let you know, that after some real soul-searching..."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_sorter/0/g-0/8
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "I'm in love with you for real this time."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_sorter/0/g-0/19
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "This time, the love comes from the right place - from loving myself first."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_sorter/0/g-0/27
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "Would you be my biggest fan?"
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_sorter/0/g-0/35/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Of course I would, Fantina."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_sorter/0/g-0/36/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Oh... actually I was hoping we could just be friends?"
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_sorter/0/g-0/c-2/7
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "You mean it?"
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_sorter/0/g-0/c-2/15
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "I'm ready. To love you in the best way. To allow you and me to share space together."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_sorter/0/g-0/c-2/23
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "Because I deserve it, dammit!"
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_sorter/0/g-0/c-2/34/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "We deserve each other."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_sorter/0/g-0/c-2/34/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Hell yes!"
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_sorter/0/g-0/c-2/34/g-0/0
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "Now, let's get to cooling off all this tension, shall we?"
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_sorter/0/g-0/c-3/7
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "Haha, well damn Fantina you sure are bad at reading the room!"
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_sorter/0/g-0/c-3/15
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "Sure, friends it is. For real this time."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_hate_return/0/0
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "You ruiner of lives."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_hate_return/0/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "That's me."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_hate_return/0/9/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I was a wrecking ball to you. (USE POISE CANDY)"
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_hate_return/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "How dare you come back to me."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_hate_return/0/c-1/13
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "Yeah, you were. You tore me down completely."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_hate_return/0/c-1/21/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'm sorry, Fantina."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_hate_return/0/c-1/21/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I was taking out my frustrations on you."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_hate_return/0/c-1/21/g-0/0
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "That's good to hear."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_hate_return/0/c-1/21/g-0/8/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Can we be friends?"
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_hate_return/0/c-1/21/g-0/8/c-0/7
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "We can try."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_hate_return/0/c-1/21/g-0/8/c-0/15
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "You can pick me up for starters."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_friend_real_return/0/0
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "Heya friendo!"
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_friend_real_return/0/8/b/1
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "I forgive ya for all that mess."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_friend_real_return/0/11/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Thanks, Fantina!"
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_friend_real_return/0/12/s/0 fantina_fan/fantina_love_real_return/0/17/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'm ready to Realize you, Fantina."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_friend_real_return/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "You spend your time with Fantina cooling off, and staying cool."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_love_real_return/0/0
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "Damn, you're hot!"
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_love_real_return/0/8
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "Lemme cool you a little!"
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_love_real_return/0/16/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "That feels great!"
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_love_real_return/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "You spend your time with your lover Fantina cooling off, and staying cool."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_realize_join/0/0
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "Woah - I've already been on such a journey with you... I dunno if I could handle any more!"
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_realize_join/0/8
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "Can you... really do it?"
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_realize_join/0/25/s/0 fantina_fan/fantina_love_toxic_realize_join/0/g-0/17/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Yes, I have what it takes."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_realize_join/0/26/s/0 fantina_fan/fantina_realize_return/0/26/s/0 fantina_fan/fantina_love_toxic_realize_join/0/g-0/18/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "No, not just yet."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_realize_join/0/c-1/10
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "No problemo. I'll sit tight!"
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_realize_return/0/0
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "Oh - you've come back! Your presence always makes me so happy."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_realize_return/0/8
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "Is it time?"
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_realize_return/0/25/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Yes, it's time!"
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_realize_return/0/c-1/10
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "You gave me a second chance - so I can always hang in there for you."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_realize_begin/6/b/1
msgctxt "Skylar"
msgid "Can Realization bring someone to life brimming with such positive energy? Here's hoping..."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_realize_begin/9
msgctxt "Skylar"
msgid "Fantina - let's fill you with cheer!"
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_realize_begin/20 fantina_fan/fantina_love_toxic_realize_begin/17
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "The spectral energy flows through your dateviators, and what was once merely a fan, becomes...."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_realized/0/3
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "For a moment you wonder if perhaps it hasn't worked—Fantina stands in place, looking around in an oscillating sort of motion just the way she used to."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_realized/0/8
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "But then she's moving far more organically, feeling herself all over and riding the rollercoaster of newly human emotions."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_realized/0/13 fantina_fan/fantina_love_toxic_realize_join/0/0
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "Oh. My. GOD."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_realized/0/24 fantina_fan/fantina_love_toxic_realize_join/0/8
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "This absolutely can NOT be real."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_realized/0/32 fantina_fan/fantina_love_toxic_realize_join/0/16
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "This can not be happening right now! Somebody pinch me!"
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_realized/0/40 fantina_fan/fantina_love_toxic_realize_join/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "If I’m not bleeding you’re not pinching hard enough!"
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_realized/0/48
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "I just can not believe it. This is legit cray!"
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_realized/0/56
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "I’m so, SO close to shaking, crying, and throwing up..."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_realized/0/64
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "But now I’m concerned actual fluids would come out of me."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_realized/0/72
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "Is that normal?"
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_realized/0/80/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Depends from where..."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_realized/0/81/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Yeah, it's normal! You're gonna do great."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_realized/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "Yipes!"
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_realized/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "Thank you for believing in me."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_realized/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "God there’s so much I want to do, ya know?"
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_realized/0/g-0/8
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "So many fandoms I can participate in! I have so much love in me to go around!"
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_realized/0/g-0/16
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "Like, don’t get me wrong, being your number one fan was really, really great."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_realized/0/g-0/24
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "But now I can do whatever - be a fan of anything - anyone! Even a fan of ...everyone!"
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_realized/0/g-0/35
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "It’s amazing... and you did that for me."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_realized/0/g-0/43/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "It was my pleasure..."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_realized/0/g-0/44/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Sounds like someone’s still a pretty big fan of yours truly. Wanna kiss?"
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_love_divert/0/8
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "And I know our relationship has always been a little complicated."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_love_divert/0/16
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "But maybe - now that I’m alive - it’d be a good opportunity for us to start things over on the right foot."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_love_divert/0/24
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "As human equals. What do you think?"
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_love_divert/0/32/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I’d like that."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_love_divert/0/33/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Aw man..."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_love_divert/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "Thank you, my love."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_love_divert/0/c-0/18
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Fantina draws closer to you, taking her time to savor every moment. Her nose brushes yours, her sweet breath warming your lips in a sort of reverse echo of her old life as a fan."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_love_divert/0/c-0/23
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "You almost wonder if she's having second thoughts, but then she's surging forward to capture your lips, and all thought vanishes from your mind."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_love_divert/0/c-0/28
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Now that the two of you are on equal footing Fantina's love truly blows you away—all that prior fanclub passion never quite vanished, and she channels it effectively now."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_love_divert/0/c-0/33
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "She praises you throughout, but her sweet words are grounded now, every one of them making you feel as though you could truly do anything."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_love_divert/0/c-0/38
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Perhaps most pleasant of all, however, are the moments afterwards, when the two you bask in the breeze of your old fan together, content and exhausted."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_love_divert/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "Patience. There's so much time."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_love_join/0
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "And so, with a veritable buffet of options to gorge herself on, Fantina set out to find her place among what she considered the most promising fandoms."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_love_join/5
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "She tried being a band groupie, a thiscord mod, a Datereon subscriber."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_love_join/10
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "But nothing gave her the same heady satisfaction as the simple positivity of cheering someone on for being themselves..."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_love_join/15
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "That is, until she found out about actual cheerleading."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_love_join/20
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "Woohoo!!!"
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_love_join/28
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "And again in typical Fantina fashion - her first day on the field found her having trouble focusing on the task at hand..."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_love_join/33
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "Go team!!"
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_love_join/44
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "Go other team!!!"
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_love_join/52
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "Go concessions staff!!!"
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_love_join/63
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "GO PEOPLE EATING HOT DOGS!!!"
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_love_join/71
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Her irrepressible ebullience led to her becoming the mascot of sports in general - and soon to take on the world at large."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_love_join/76
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "The world's first traveling non-denominational cheerleader - Fantina gives love and support wherever it is needed... and especially when it's unexpected."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_love_join/81
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "Great job mailing that letter!"
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_love_join/89
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "Goooooo bank tellers!"
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_love_join/97
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "I wanna hear some PARKING SUPPORT!!"
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_love_join/105
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "It's adorable."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_love_toxic_realize_join/0/24/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "<i>Pinch her.</i>"
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_love_toxic_realize_join/0/25/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "<i>Smile politely.</i>"
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_love_toxic_realize_join/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "Can you really do it?"
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_love_toxic_realize_join/0/g-0/c-3/10
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "Not a problem. TOTALLY understandable."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_love_toxic_realize_join/0/g-0/c-3/18
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "I get mixed up all the time about understandable things like that."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_love_toxic_realize_begin/3/b/1
msgctxt "Skylar"
msgid "Taking the easy path for your first one, huh?"
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_love_toxic_realize_begin/6
msgctxt "Skylar"
msgid "Seems like Fantina is very ready to be your new human. Maybe too ready..."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_realized_toxic/0/0
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Fantina's eyes are wide as she inspects her new body, but her wonder is cut short when she meets your gaze. She almost seems surprised to see you."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_realized_toxic/0/5
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "WHOA!"
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_realized_toxic/0/13
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "You're here! You're so..."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_realized_toxic/0/21
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "Human."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_realized_toxic/0/32
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Fantina's normally happy demeanor begins to change."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_realized_toxic/0/37/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You okay?"
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_realized_toxic/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "...yeah."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_realized_toxic/0/c-0/15
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "You just... have all those."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_realized_toxic/0/c-0/23
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "Things."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_realized_toxic/0/c-0/34/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Hair?"
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_realized_toxic/0/c-0/34/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Odors?"
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_realized_toxic/0/c-0/34/2/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Political opinions?"
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_realized_toxic/0/c-0/34/g-0/0
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "She curls her lip, looking positively disgusted with you."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_realized_toxic/0/c-0/34/g-0/5
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "Yeah."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_realized_toxic/0/c-0/34/g-0/13
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "Kinda icky if I'm being real."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_realized_toxic/0/g-0/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You are real... and I'm really surprised."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_realized_toxic/0/g-0/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I can't believe this! I thought you would love me!"
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_realized_toxic/0/g-0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "Yeah, same. Guess they say never meet your heroes."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_realized_toxic/0/g-0/c-2/7
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "Meh. I moved on."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_realized_toxic/0/g-1/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Well then, so have I."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_realized_toxic/0/g-1/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Can I at least get a little something-something before you go?"
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_love_toxic_divert/0
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "Yeah, sure."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_love_toxic_divert/8
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Fantina grabs you by the shoulders and plants a firm, though perfunctory kiss on your lips. It's breezy, but more than anything... cold."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_love_toxic_divert/13
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "See you on the flip."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_love_toxic_divert/21
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "You did not, in fact, see her on the flip."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_love_toxic_join/4
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Fantina struck out on her own, disillusioned with being a fan of anything."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_love_toxic_join/9
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Everywhere she went, there were reminders that the real world had imperfections; that things weren't always as they appeared from up close."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_love_toxic_join/14
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "You're telling me I swallow bugs in my sleep now? Oh, come on!"
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_love_toxic_join/22
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "That is, until she found television."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_love_toxic_join/27
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Bathed in the glow of the white light, Fantina finds solace in the one thing that always transmits a perfect world in the way she always imagined it."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_love_toxic_join/32
msgctxt "Fantina"
msgid "Now THAT'S what I can believe in."
msgstr ""

#: fantina_fan/fantina_love_toxic_join/40
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "This is what some would call... a bad ending."
msgstr ""
